Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Def: 3D Geodesic", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.933822136778759*^9, 3.933822141257318*^9}, {
  3.933822367158099*^9, 3.933822367552326*^9}, {3.934084323163286*^9, 
  3.934084338601632*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"18d0aa64-8ff7-4c7e-ab4f-\
b3596f7a9be7"],

Cell["\<\
In this section we first define a numeric code that integrates the geodesic \
equation to obtain the parameterized trajectory of a geodesic. Then we define \
a function used to demonstrate the geodesic in 3D.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953557082384472*^9, 3.953557203884474*^9}, {
  3.953558447895162*^9, 
  3.953558454083828*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7c5cbd4e-0122-43c3-84d2-\
44aae431664b"],

